  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection et assistance multisectorielle vitale aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s nouvellement arriv&#xe9;s au Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide life-saving, multi-sectoral refugee assistance to almost 21,000 newly arrived refugees from Burkina Faso as well as over 6,000 people among the host communities. This UNHCR project provides multi-sectoral humanitarian assistance, including cash, protection, shelter, health and education, to over 27,000 people, including over 7,900 women, over 15,000 children, and including almost 170 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
